AudD  ·  profile default
                 │ Recognize › File
*1 Recognize     > Recognize music in a file, URL, or folder
 2 Now playing   │ 
 3 Streams       │   Source     ‹ File, URL, or folder ›
 4 Recognitions  │ › Input*     a file, URL, or folder                         
 5 Account       │   [ ] Add Apple Music data (link, artwork, track length)
 6 Settings      │   [ ] Add Spotify data (link, artwork, popularity)
 7 Help          │   [ ] Add Deezer data (link, artwork)
                 │   [ ] Add MusicBrainz data (IDs and release details)
                 │   [ ] Enterprise: scan the whole file
                 │   Max files  e.g. 100, or none
                 │   Clip at    e.g. 1:30
                 │   [ ] Send even if cached
                 │ 
                 │   [ Recognize ]  [ Show the plan ]
                 │   Enter a file, URL, or folder first
                 │ 
                 │   A file, URL, folder, or glob; enter recognizes it. ctrl+o
 ctrl+k commands │   picks a file.
 ? keys  q quit  │ 

↑/↓ field  enter recognize  esc leave the field  ctrl+u clear
$ audd recognize '<file>'                                                 y copy